astrobench_cc18f51e25,astrobench_cc18f51e25_chunk_009,9,"Miand thus does not contribute to the averaged Hamiltonian in secular theories limited to ﬁrst-order in planetary masses. We therefore focus in this work on the expansion of the dir ect partU1, which encapsulates the main complexity of the perturbing function and go verns the secular dynamics of planetary systems. We focus primarily on the planar pro blem and begin by summarizing the two classical methods used to expand this term. 3","U1, (1)","U1, (1)",,,,,Laplace-Legendre expansion of the planar planetary Hamiltonian,"Aya Alnajjarine, Jacques Laskar, Federico Mogavero",astro-ph.EP,2026-03-17T13:51:12Z,http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.16528v1,2603.16528,action_angle_methods,94,72,False,False,140,212
